ADDITIONAL NOTICE — FINANCIAL RISK

This software places orders against live cryptocurrency exchanges. It is
published as an engineering artifact, not as financial advice, and not as a
product.

  * Nothing here is investment advice or a recommendation to trade.
  * No strategy in this repository has been shown to be profitable. The README
    says so, and the promotion gate exists specifically to stop you skipping
    that step.
  * You are solely responsible for any capital you put at risk, for the
    exchange credentials you configure, and for the regulatory and tax
    consequences in your jurisdiction.
  * The "no warranty" clause above applies in full, including to losses
    arising from defects, outages, or misconfiguration.

Run it in paper mode. Read ARCHITECTURE.md before you do anything else.
